It is a derivative work of the dsh-webchat plugin, which is also licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The following parts are carried over
from that project:

  - the browser engine that drives chat.deepseek.com through playwright-core
    (src/engine/engine.ts, src/engine/html-md.ts)
  - the transcript store and the web-side transcript parsing
    (src/store.ts, and the recover paths in src/routes.ts)
  - the distillation / transfer machinery that turns a web conversation into
    a harness session (src/transfer.ts)

The panel UI, the slot registration (sidebar.panellist / main), the route
namespace (/api/dsh-dschat/*) and the tool namespace (dschat_*) were rewritten
for this plugin; the namespaces are independent so both plugins can be installed
side by side. No `settings.section` page is registered: engine and connection
status live in the panel's own 「运行状态」 card.
